# Build context for product_mvp/Dockerfile, which is this repository's root.
#
# The repository carries test fixtures, experiment artefacts and papers that the
# image has no use for. Exclude everything, then re-include the two trees the
# service actually imports and serves.

*
!product_mvp
!product_mvp/**
!agent_metabolism
!agent_metabolism/**

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.lake
**/node_modules
**/.git
product_mvp/tests
product_mvp/*.md
product_mvp/.venv
